{'symbol': 'ALL', 'date': '2022-04-11 16:37:00', 'title': 'ALLSTATE ANNOUNCES RETIREMENT OF VICE CHAIR, DON CIVGIN AND SENIOR LEADERSHIP CHANGE', 'text': "NORTHBROOK, ILL.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--AFTER A DISTINGUISHED 13-YEAR CAREER AT ALLSTATE, DON CIVGIN, VICE CHAIR AND CEO, PROTECTION PRODUCTS AND SERVICES HAS ANNOUNCED HIS DECISION TO RETIRE, EFFECTIVE MAY 1. DON JOINED THE COMPANY AS CHIEF FINANCIAL OFFICER IN 2008, BECAME PRESIDENT AND CEO OF ALLSTATE FINANCIAL IN 2012 AND VICE CHAIR OF THE ALLSTATE CORPORATION IN 2019. HE ALSO SERVES AS CHAIRMAN OF THE INTERNATIONALLY RENOWNED RAVINIA® FESTIVAL. WITH DON'S RETIREMENT, TERRANCE WILLIAMS WILL BECO"}